        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: American Idol: Greatest Moments\n- People: Justin Guarini, Kelly Clarkson\n- Events: American Idol season 1\n- Topics: soundtrack albums, finalists\n\nFacts:\n- In 2002, Justin Guarini was the runner-up on the first season of American Idol.\n- Justin Guarini was born as Justin Eldrin Bell on October 28, 1978.\n- Justin Guarini is an American singer, musician, actor, host, and producer.\n- American Idol: Greatest Moments is the first American Idol soundtrack and features music from the first season of American Idol.\n- American Idol: Greatest Moments contains two cover songs by Kelly Clarkson and two cover songs by Justin Guarini.\n- American Idol: Greatest Moments includes one song from each of the remaining eight finalists and one song by all the finalists.\n- American Idol: Greatest Moments includes Kelly Clarkson's two songs from her debut single as bonus tracks.",
